cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use camt053-lsp in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "camt053-lsp: Language Server Protocol server for ISO 20022 reversing-entry files"
abstract: >-
  A Language Server Protocol server for authoring the JSON and JSONC
  reversing-entry records that drive ISO 20022 camt.053 reversal generation
  in the camt053 library: schema and IBAN/BIC diagnostics, completion,
  hover, code actions, document symbols and formatting over stdio.
authors:
